{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1398005-question-on-virtues","id":1398005,"title":"Question on Virtues.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-21T10:16:24-07:00","id":1398005,"title":"Question on Virtues.","content":"What is a roll with virtue? Is it when you do something that aligns with that virtue you add that many dice to the roll? For example, if an Aesir does something audacious and he is 2 points towards audacity do they get to add 2 dice to the roll? Additionally in Scion it says this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Every point of Momentum you spend to augment a roll with a Virtue receives an additional die per point of Virtue track that doesn\u2019t come out of the pool</i> </div> </div> </div>Then it goes on to state that if you are at the end of a Virtue track you get the virtuous condition which grants this as it's effect:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>Every point of Momentum you spend to augment a roll with a Virtue receives an additional die that doesn\u2019t come out of the pool.</i> </div> </div> </div>So, if I am 5 points towards Audacity I gain the virtuous condition, then I do something audacious, does each point of momentum I spend give me 6 extra dice?<br /> <br /> Sorry if this has been explained elsewhere, I've done some browsing and haven't seen the question answered, also I apologize if this is clarified pretty clearly in the book and I just happened to miss it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26245-nutsupial","name":"Nutsupial","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T10:32:07-07:00","id":1398012,"title":"","content":"Not exactly.<br /> <br /> You don\u2019t have a \u201cvalue\u201d for for Virtues, it works like a clock, one mark (or pointer) that move from one side to the other, along the 5 positions. If it is pointed to one of the extremes you are virtuous to that virtue and gain 1 extra die for every momentum used, basically 1 momentum generates 2 dice, 2 momentum generates 4 dice, etc.<br /> <br /> Post 34, 35 and 36 on the link below.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\"> Systematic Questions, PLEASE FOR THE LOVE OF GODS HELP! - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1309822-systematic-questions-please-for-the-love-of-gods-help </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Ok I will have more then this but for now: How does skill selection work in character generation work? The path section says you choose 3 skills but certain of the paths in Origin seem to have a varying amount of selections to choose from (examples being Suburbia having the skills: Culture, Empathy, or Technology vs Chosen which has: Culture, Integrity Occult, or Subterfuge vs Created which just states a flat Athletics, Empathy, Survival). </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 06-21-2020, 01:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T11:23:40-07:00","id":1398025,"title":"","content":"Of note, the whole &quot;Extra Dice Per Momentum&quot; depends on how exactly you're parsing the Momentum Rules. If you say that the player spends the Momentum total, then you can have situations of doubling or tripling your Momentum Dice. If you'd rather the players not get 12 dice off of 4 Momentum then you can go with the rule suggestion of &quot;Each player can spend one die on any roll&quot; for the whole unity thing, and in that case only the Momentum spent by the Virtuous Player gets the bonus dice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T13:48:35-07:00","id":1398057,"title":"","content":"This was very helpful, thanks so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26245-nutsupial","name":"Nutsupial","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}